# PDF Info Extractor

This project is a plain Java Maven project for reading PDF files and extracting important information like:
- Name
- Email address
- Phone number
- Address
- Company

## Features
- Uses Apache PDFBox to read PDF text
- Extracts common personal/business info using regex and heuristics
- Works well for text-based PDFs
- Easy to run from command line

## Requirements
- Java 17+
- Maven 3+

## Build

```bash
mvn clean package
```

## Run

```bash
java -jar target/pdf-info-extractor-1.0.0.jar your-file.pdf
```

## Example output

```text
Name: John Doe
Email: john.doe@example.com
Phone: +1 555 123 4567
Address: 123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001
Company: Example Inc
```

## Notes
For scanned PDFs or image-only PDFs, OCR would be required in addition to PDFBox.
